repository-code: "https://github.com/DilshadDigonta/cDSP-Based-BO-MATLAB-ICME"

abstract: "This repository contains a MATLAB implementation of a Bayesian Optimization (BO) framework integrated with the compromise Decision Support Problem (cDSP) construct for robust, uncertainty-aware design in Integrated Computational Materials Engineering (ICME) applications. The repository includes an analytical benchmark problem and an industry-inspired test problem."

keywords:
  - Bayesian Optimization
  - Gaussian Process
  - compromise Decision Support Problem
  - Decision-Based Design
  - Robust Design
  - Uncertainty Quantification
  - Integrated Computational Materials Engineering (ICME)
  - MATLAB

